  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Open Call ODA Compliant Awards 2017/2018 -After the Earth&apos;s Violent Sway: the tangible and intangible legacies of a natural disaster</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research studying the impact that the 2015 earthquakes had on Nepali society. It will examine public discourse to understand social change. Beneficiaries: government, international agencies delivering relief and development. SDGs:11, 13, 16</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
